      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Voice Selection**\n\nI've successfully created the `select_voice.py` file. It leverages Google Cloud Text-to-Speech to enumerate available voices. The function `select_voice` is ready for implementation, and I can clearly identify the provider by its imports.\n\n\n**Confirming Voice Functionality**\n\nI've confirmed the initial functionality of `select_voice.py`, using Google Cloud Text-to-Speech to list available voices. The `select_voice` function is prepared; the provider identification through `from google.cloud import texttospeech` and client initialization is complete. I'm now ready to move onto the next phase.\n\n\n",
