      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Code for SSML**\n\nI've crafted the `synthesize_ssml.py` file, enabling text-to-speech with precise voice and prosody adjustments via SSML, using Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. The example usage within the `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` block showcases the code's practical application. The structure ensures standalone functionality.\n\n\n**Concluding SSML Implementation**\n\nI've finalized the `synthesize_ssml.py` script. It's fully functional, leveraging Google Cloud's Text-to-Speech API to achieve the desired SSML-based voice and prosody control. A practical usage example is included. The script is self-contained. I consider this phase complete.\n\n\n",
